WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.800
This is DuoSign. Right now, 430 million
people worldwide are deaf or hard of

00:05.800 --> 00:09.540
hearing. And the technology we built in
the past has mostly gone in one direction,

00:10.000 --> 00:16.280
helping people understand them. DuoSign
goes the other way. You type, you speak,

00:16.480 --> 00:20.600
there are Avatar signs. No interpreter, no
app to download. Happens right here in

00:20.600 --> 00:26.700
your browser. So here we are. This is the
main screen. We've got the dark mode,

00:26.740 --> 00:30.660
light mode toggle. For this tutorial, I'll
do it in dark mode. Here's the 

00:30.660 --> 00:34.580
profile menu. So DuoSign allows you to have
three free transcriptions. But once you

00:34.580 --> 00:39.160
sign in, you're able to have access for
all. So I'm going to type the text, "Hello

00:39.160 --> 00:45.580
viewers". And you're going to see
that sign as well. This avatar is going to

00:45.580 --> 00:52.300
perform the sign again. And as you can
see, it's a bit wonky. But this is just

00:52.300 --> 00:56.760
version one. Over here is our history
page. So in the history page, you can see

00:56.760 --> 01:00.380
all the translations that were done. You
can look at them, you can export them as

01:00.380 --> 01:05.780
video, and you can hit download. In our
settings page, we have a load of settings

01:05.780 --> 01:11.260
you can choose from to customize however
you like it. Over here, I'm going to enter

01:11.260 --> 01:16.300
some text. I'm going to say "help me find
the duster". The avatar is

01:16.300 --> 01:22.240
going to perform that sign. And the best
part is I can download this video. So you

01:22.240 --> 01:29.360
can also change the avatar mode from full
body or close-up or a 3D world view, where

01:29.360 --> 01:36.620
you can see the avatar in full 3D and
interact with it. If you get lost or want
    
01:36.620 --> 01:40.200
to understand how DuoSign works, there's
some documentation to help you. You can

01:40.200 --> 01:46.060
read all about it here. DuoSign isn't
perfect yet. The vocabulary is just 2,000

01:46.060 --> 01:51.900
words. The avatar is still improving. But
it's free and it's going to be free just

01:51.900 --> 01:56.560
for you. As such, it's very important that
when you're done using the app, you do

01:56.560 --> 02:00.440
take part in the survey and tell us what
part of DuoSign you liked and what part

02:00.440 --> 02:04.660
you didn't like and how we can improve it
further. You can tell us your thoughts.

02:05.020 --> 02:10.060
You can leave bad reviews if you like.
Just be honest and be transparent. We'll

02:10.060 --> 02:14.200
be working on it and we'll definitely be
sending you updates from time to time on

02:14.200 --> 02:14.940
the progress of our app.

